# Lluwen's ability: {2}{B/G}{B/G}{B/G}, {T}, discard a land card. Bot1 puts the milled Grizzly Bears back on top and draws it on
# turn three, but the cost can't discard it (not a land card). The Forest milled on turn one and the Island discarded as the cost
# are the two land cards in Bot1's graveyard, so two Worms are created (1/1 black and green); the Island Bot2 discarded to hand
# size at its turn 2 cleanup is in Bot2's graveyard, which doesn't count.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Lluwen, Imperfect Naturalist
Forest
Island
Island
Forest
Lightning Bolt
Grizzly Bears
Giant Growth
Island x8

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lluwen, Imperfect Naturalist.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Grizzly Bears)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot2.Graveyard = Island
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Lluwen, Imperfect Naturalist.Activate
! Bot1.Choose(Grizzly Bears)
Bot1.Choose(Island)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Worm Token#1.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Worm Token#1.Colors.Count = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Worm Token#2.Toughness = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Worm Token#3 = (absent)
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Lluwen, Imperfect Naturalist.Tapped = true
